  "description": "Maximum chirp — the soliton's frequency sweeping upward through the note. The chirped pulse: a wave whose carrier frequency increases along its envelope, like a bat echolocation call. High attack shock, fast velocity. Every note is a frequency slide from low to high compressed into milliseconds.",
